OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ASuspected China spy linked to Nvidia's
OL,4,Aex-boss left in 2025, Megaspeed says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMegaspeed is the biggest buyer of
OL,7,FNvidia chips in South East Asia and the
OL,8,Fscandal at Nvidia has raised questions
OL,9,Fabout the possibility that high-end AI
OL,10,Fchips may have ended up in China
OL,11,Fdespite US export restrictions.
OL,13,FThe Singapore-based company said on
OL,14,FSunday it had launched an internal
OL,15,Finvestigation into its business.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
